  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 49a9dd75b14f64f43a98b9b523c7ac90, type: 3}
  m_Name: DanCubicle
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  _concurrentDialogue:
  - "It all just feels so insignificant now\u2026 Like that time that you took the
    last coffee in the pot right before I got there. Or the many times you shot down
    all of my ideas in our meetings."
  - "Every little slight that I took so personally, doesn\u2019t seem like such a
    big problem anymore..."
  - " I hope you\u2019re okay, Dan. "
  - "Even though we\u2019ve buttheads many times, I would give anything to have you
    working here with me again\u2026"
  - Do you have a family?
  - "It\u2019s funny, I\u2019d always assumed you were an eternal bachelor, but I
    now find myself hoping you have someone to hold you one last time before the
    end."
  - ' I hope your absence these past couple days means you found that person.'
  - " I hope it doesn\u2019t mean that you finally succumbed to the infection\u2026"
  - I hope you and your companion cherish each other.
  - Would I have hated you if I just tried to talk to you a few more times? Tried
    to understand you?
  - "I don\u2019t even know if I hate you now. I think I just miss you."
  - 'You did mean something to me, I guess. '
  _characterName: You
  _nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  _choices: {fileID: 0}
